Description: Remote Shutdown master - LAN parental control console
 Central service of Remote Shutdown: HTTPS web console (machines UP/DOWN,
 uptime, IP/MAC, shutdown, popup, chat, uptime limits), mutual-TLS agent hub,
 local certificate authority with automatic agent enrollment, UDP discovery
 and a hash-chained audit log.
